780" end="00:23.990">and </span><span begin="00:23.990" end="00:24.470">girls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.470" end="00:28.460"><span begin="00:24.470" end="00:24.770">Tell </span><span begin="00:24.770" end="00:24.980">your </span><span begin="00:24.980" end="00:25.730">brother</span><span begin="00:25.730" end="00:25.760">, </span><span begin="00:25.760" end="00:26.000">your </span><span begin="00:26.000" end="00:26.600">sister </span><span begin="00:26.600" end="00:26.840">and </span><span begin="00:26.840" end="00:27.080">your </span><span begin="00:27.080" end="00:27.800">mamma </span><span begin="00:27.800" end="00:28.460">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.610" end="00:30.770"><span begin="00:28.610" end="00:29.000">We're </span><span begin="00:29.000" end="00:29.450">about </span><span begin="00:29.450" end="00:29.660">to </span><span begin="00:29.660" end="00:30.140">go </span><span begin="00:30.140" end="00:30.770">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.770" end="00:32.720"><span begin="00:30.770" end="00:30.980">And </span><span begin="00:30.980" end="00:31.190">you </span><span begin="00:31.190" end="00:31.460">know </span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:31.760">just </span><span begin="00:31.760" end="00:32.000">what </span><span begin="00:32.000" end="00:32.240">to </span><span begin="00:32.240" end="00:32.720">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.750" end="00:37.100"><span begin="00:32.750" end="00:33.080">Wave </span><span begin="00:33.080" end="00:33.320">your </span><span begin="00:33.320" end="00:33.890">hands </span><span begin="00:33.890" end="00:34.070">in </span><span begin="00:34.070" end="00:34.430">the </span><span begin="00:34.430" end="00:34.820">air </span><span begin="00:34.820" end="00:35.300">like </span><span begin="00:35.300" end="00:35.660">you </span><span begin="00:35.660" end="00:36.050">don't </span><span begin="00:36.050" end="00:37.100">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.100" end